 financial advantage, raising roughly three and a half times Whatley's total and holding far more cash, though outside groups have spent heavily on the Republican's behalf. Analysts across the spectrum rate the race Likely Democratic, with a pair calling it Lean Democratic, and prediction markets put Democratic odds near 96 percent. The state's slight Republican lean and the open-seat dynamic leave some uncertainty, but the evidence points to a clear Cooper advantage heading into the final weeks.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9425, "margin": 7.94}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.93, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9375, "margin": 8.2}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9346, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9278, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9264, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9322, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.939, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9386, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9577, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9557, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9557, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9528, "margin": 8.8}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9512, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9379, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9381, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.956, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9414, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9393, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9452, "margin": 9.2}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9528, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.965, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.965, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.9374, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.9506, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.9516, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0